{"id":"331ebd81d6d8c956","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-algebraic-lattice.md","title":"Algebraic Lattice","display":"df-algebraic-lattice — Algebraic Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-algebraic-lattice","aliases":["58-df-algebraic-lattice"],"display":"df-algebraic-lattice — Algebraic Lattice","depends_on":["[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-algebraic-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-algebraic-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraic-lattice — Algebraic Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\">\\(L\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\;\\subseteq L\\times L\">\\(\\leq\\;\\subseteq L\\times L\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(L,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(L,\\leq)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,A;L,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,A;L,\\leq)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D;L,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D;L,\\leq)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactElement}_S(c;L,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactElement}_S(c;L,\\leq)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgLat}(L,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgLat}(L,\\leq)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,A;L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(A\\subseteq L\\land s\\in L\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq s)\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;\\left(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq u)\\to s\\leq u\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,A;L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(A\\subseteq L\\land s\\in L\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq s)\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;\\left(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq u)\\to s\\leq u\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}directed} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D;L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\varnothing\\neq D\\subseteq L\\land\n\\forall d,e\\in D\\;\\exists u\\in D\\;(d\\leq u\\land e\\leq u)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}directed} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D;L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\varnothing\\neq D\\subseteq L\\land\n\\forall d,e\\in D\\;\\exists u\\in D\\;(d\\leq u\\land e\\leq u)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}compact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactElement}_S(c;L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(c\\in L\\land\n\\forall D\\subseteq L\\;\\forall s\\in L\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D;L,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,D;L,\\leq)\\land c\\leq s\n\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(c\\leq d)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}compact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactElement}_S(c;L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(c\\in L\\land\n\\forall D\\subseteq L\\;\\forall s\\in L\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D;L,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,D;L,\\leq)\\land c\\leq s\n\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(c\\leq d)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgLat}(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Poset}(L,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\exists s\\in L\\;\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,A;L,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall x\\in L\\;\\mathrm{Sup}_S\\!\\left(x,\\{c\\in L:\\mathrm{CompactElement}_S(c;L,\\leq)\\land c\\leq x\\};L,\\leq\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgLat}(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Poset}(L,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\exists s\\in L\\;\\mathrm{Sup}_S(s,A;L,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall x\\in L\\;\\mathrm{Sup}_S\\!\\left(x,\\{c\\in L:\\mathrm{CompactElement}_S(c;L,\\leq)\\land c\\leq x\\};L,\\leq\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Algebraic lattices are generated by their compact elements under joins.</li>\n<li>上确界、定向集与紧元素均由局部谓词展开，不再依赖未定义的选择记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\leq}\">\\(\\bigvee_{\\leq}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt"